   397	Provider order is deterministic Kahn topological order: among currently ready
   398	providers select the lexicographically smallest skill name by Unicode scalar
   399	value. The synthetic project is not emitted. Diagnostic requirement chains use
   400	the lexicographically smallest complete chain when multiple chains are equal
   401	in length.
