   427	The snapshot MUST contain only directories and regular files; links, special
   428	files, invalid protocol paths, duplicate encoded paths, and platform path
   429	collisions are invalid. For every regular file, convert its relative protocol
   430	path to `/` separators without normalization and encode its Unicode scalar
   431	values as UTF-8. Sort those path bytes in unsigned bytewise order. Initialize
